  "description": "The documents every credit proposal needs, by product, segment, case type and policy clause, published to Data Domains as dd_document_rule (ids DR-nn, shared with the product templates). A rule applies when its product, segment and case-type lists match (\"*\" matches any; product ids of backend/dealdesk/products/templates.py; segment corporate or sme). 'scope' expands a rule to one item per group entity, UBO, other bank, guarantor, project or collateral. 'validity_days' marks a document expired once it is older (0 = no expiry); 'evidence' names the deal-file field that proves receipt when no dd_document row exists.",
  "statuses": [
    "received",
    "pending",
    "expired",
    "waived"
  ],
